[stderr] +loss hazards; unsupported browser/device or assistive-tech assumptions;
[stderr] +unapproved performance targets; original-design/provenance failure; and
[stderr] +manifest/ID drift across resumed authoring waves. Mitigate each by retaining
[stderr] +the named gate, keeping save/cache responsibilities separated, requiring
[stderr] +provenance and human creative review, and using the F013 ledger plus F015
[stderr] +quality gate before dispatching further work.
